{"type":"text","timestamp":1794565205023,"sessionID":"ses_e2b9698caffeLgfL2URRQHee3D","part":{"id":"prt_1d46bdf97002u3O5UIkGnOfoyn","sessionID":"ses_e2b9698caffeLgfL2URRQHee3D","messageID":"msg_1d46bba6600166wZuEM1SyB5cR","type":"text","text":"T020 is implemented and both verify commands pass.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts` — added `rollingDegradedRate` and `lastRecordAt` to `hookHealth`, `.strict()` kept.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-status.ts` — guard now `hookHealthSection.lastRecordAt !== null`, and the block reports `rollingDegradedRate` and `lastRecordAt`.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts` — added `reports the newest record time and the degraded share` with the two timestamped records, asserting `lastRecordAt` `2026-11-13T08:00:05.000Z`, `rollingDegradedRate` 0.5 and a successful `AdvisorStatusOutputSchema.parse`.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts` in `$ADV`:\n\n```\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\n     Tests  32 passed (32)\n```\n\n0 failed. `npm run typecheck` in `$ADV` exited 0, confirmed as `TYPECHECK_EXIT=0`.\n\n**Not done**\n- The T020 checkbox is untouched, no commit or git write was made.\n- Nothing was blocked.\n\nOne note for the coordinator: the test file also carries another worker's uncommitted T012 cases (`writes a health record without the debug variable...`, `trims the default health log...`). I left them as I found them and appended only the new T020 case.\n\nNothing is yours to do beyond ticking T020 after review, if that is the coordinator's step.","time":{"start":1794565201815,"end":1794565205023}}}
